          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <h3>Registration (Art. 10)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>CGPA ≥ 3.3:</strong> up to 21 cr/semester</li>
            <li><strong>CGPA 2.0–3.3:</strong> up to 18 cr</li>
            <li><strong>CGPA &lt; 2.0:</strong> up to 12 cr</li>
            <li><strong>Min registration:</strong> 9 cr (main semesters)</li>
            <li><strong>Summer:</strong> max 6 cr (9 for graduation)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <h3>Study Duration (Art. 8)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Minimum: <strong>7 regular semesters</strong></li>
